{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will play the role of a housewife and experience all the household duties firsthand. The incentive is a tyrannical husband who will watch you and punish inadequate quality of work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/extras/57e703b7036b06e579c226967eed4237.poster.avif?t=1774420517\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/extras/57e703b7036b06e579c226967eed4237.webm?t=1774420517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/extras/57e703b7036b06e579c226967eed4237.mp4?t=1774420517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to cook, wash the dishes, do the laundry, iron and dry underwear and socks, vacuum and mop the floor, scrub the toilet and the windows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/extras/5aac38ced0cb1288262b8461caf9fb5c.poster.avif?t=1774420517\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/extras/5aac38ced0cb1288262b8461caf9fb5c.webm?t=1774420517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/extras/5aac38ced0cb1288262b8461caf9fb5c.mp4?t=1774420517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, you need to keep an eye on your morale and your husband\u2019s mood. Take a bath to relax after cleaning, flatter your beloved to get a new handbag, since you can sell it and escape to a free life.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072240?t=1774420517","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072240?t=1774420517","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/46bd90ee241a6e21770d4f4de4ef300e480f8c07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774420517","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/46bd90ee241a6e21770d4f4de4ef300e480f8c07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774420517","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4366130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will play the role of a housewife and experience all the household duties firsthand. The incentive is a tyrannical husband who will watch you and punish inadequate quality of work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/extras/57e703b7036b06e579c226967eed4237.poster.avif?t=1774420517\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/extras/57e703b7036b06e579c226967eed4237.webm?t=1774420517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/extras/57e703b7036b06e579c226967eed4237.mp4?t=1774420517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to cook, wash the dishes, do the laundry, iron and dry underwear and socks, vacuum and mop the floor, scrub the toilet and the windows.<